    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "A tall bow of grey lebethron, worked by the wardens of the Grey Company from the star you kept faith with. It is the mark of one who has walked the first of the uncrowned path and kept the watch true. No further grace is set upon it yet -- the deeds of the crowned road and the mustering of the Grey Company are for a far greater day. Only a ranger may draw it."
    }
